{"author":{"is_bot":true,"login":"app/dependabot"},"baseRefName":"trunk","body":"Bumps [actions/create-github-app-token](https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token) from 3.2.0 to 3.3.0.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/releases\">actions/create-github-app-token's releases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v3.3.0</h2>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.2.0...v3.3.0\">3.3.0</a> (2026-10-12)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\">a47236f</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\">12461a3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/395\">#395</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\">a69c19d</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">actions/create-github-app-token's changelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>Changelog</h1>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.2.0...v3.3.0\">3.3.0</a> (2026-10-12)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\">a47236f</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\">12461a3</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 updates (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/395\">#395</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\">a69c19d</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/compare/v3.1.1...v3.2.0\">3.2.0</a> (2026-05-12)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>add support for enterprise-level GitHub Apps (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/263\">#263</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/952a2a7073df6bfa5f49bc469ec895b6ec1acea4\">952a2a7</a>)</li>\n<li>support full repository names in <code>repositories</code> input (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/372\">#372</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/85eb8dd41472213aed25d1a126460e0069138ab6\">85eb8dd</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>deps:</strong> bump <code>@​actions/core</code> from 3.0.0 to 3.0.1 in the production-dependencies group (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/364\">#364</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/43e5c345bfd4d4f3ecea019ad0042001a09dd857\">43e5c34</a>)</li>\n<li>validate private-key input (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/376\">#376</a>) (<a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/f24bbd89643991c0de27ae823c01791b2c6bafdd\">f24bbd8</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/64ab729a6294000f5aa4a4bc0b73d1f32bc45510\"><code>64ab729</code></a> chore(main): release 3.3.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/402\">#402</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/f3a828e4b91180d3a46ac1f4b43fa8384b0dea07\"><code>f3a828e</code></a> ci: create signed dist commits in release workflow (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/404\">#404</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/655017ffa7c6b0c6e4210729fa6bce35cacd8ca0\"><code>655017f</code></a> docs: clarify when owner grants access to all repositories (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/378\">#378</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/12461a3a794e67c032f1eff5bb95ece9427eb4fb\"><code>12461a3</code></a> fix(deps): bump nested undici from 6.24.0 to 6.29.0 (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/403\">#403</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a47236f79f79fcbc3532af49fe3a5ded89529b6e\"><code>a47236f</code></a> feat: update permission inputs (<a href=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/issues/399\">#399</a>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/a69c19ddfdf8e1ab093900e0064524ce9309c807\"><code>a69c19d</code></a> fix(deps): bump the production-dependencies group across 1 directory with 3 u...</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/actions/create-github-app-token/commit/d5cb7ae41d64331820d88810a4878e0942ec992a\"><code>d5cb7ae